---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Jr. SYME — Word of Life Korea"
  description="중·고등학생을 위한 영어 제자훈련 집중 프로그램. 말씀과 훈련으로 가득한 3주."
  activeNav="ministry"
>

<PageHero image="/images/syme-community.jpg" pos="50% 42%">
  <Fragment slot="eyebrow"><span class="wl-ko">SYME 사역</span><span class="wl-en">Ministry · SYME</span></Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="title">Jr. SYME</Fragment>
  <Fragment slot="bar">
    <p class="ph-sub">
      <span class="wl-ko">중·고등학생을 위한 영어 제자훈련 집중 프로그램. <br>말씀과 훈련으로 가득한 3주가 다음 세대를 세웁니다.</span>
      <span class="wl-en">An intensive English discipleship training program for middle &amp; high school students, 3 weeks of God's Word.</span>
    </p>
    <dl class="ph-stats ph-stats--text">
      <div class="ph-stat"><dt><span class="wl-ko">학생 대상</span><span class="wl-en">Students</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">중·고등</span><span class="wl-en">Gr. 7–12</span></dd></div>
      <div class="ph-stat"><dt><span class="wl-ko">집중 훈련</span><span class="wl-en">Intensive Program</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">3주</span><span class="wl-en">3 wks</span></dd></div>
      <div class="ph-stat"><dt><span class="wl-ko">여름 · 겨울 각 1회</span><span class="wl-en">Summer &amp; Winter</span></dt><dd><span class="wl-ko">방학</span><span class="wl-en">2×</span></dd></div>
    </dl>
  </Fragment>
</PageHero>

<div class="jr">

  <!-- NOTICE — 옅은 바탕 + 고른 테두리 상자 (왼쪽 강조선 없음) -->
  <div class="jr-notice-wrap">
    <div class="jr-shell">
      <div class="jr-notice" role="note">
        <p class="jr-notice-label"><span class="wl-ko">공지</span><span class="wl-en">NOTICE</span></p>
        <p class="jr-notice-text">
          <span class="wl-ko"><strong>한국 SYME는 현재 잠정 중단 중입니다.</strong> 그 동안 중·고등학생을 대상으로 Jr. SYME를 운영하고 있습니다.</span>
          <span class="wl-en"><strong>SYME Korea is currently on a temporary hold.</strong> In the meantime, Jr. SYME is available for middle &amp; high school students.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ABOUT — 왼쪽 소개, 오른쪽 세 가지 특징 줄 목록 -->
  <section class="jr-about">
    <div class="jr-shell jr-about-inner">
      <div class="jr-about-copy">
        <p class="jr-eyebrow">About Jr. SYME</p>
        <h2 class="jr-h2">
          <span class="wl-ko">복음으로 세워지는<br>다음 세대 리더</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Raising the Next Generation<br>of Gospel-Centered Leaders</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="jr-body">
          <span class="wl-ko">Jr. SYME는 방학을 활용한 3주 영어 제자훈련 프로그램입니다. 언어 학습을 넘어, Word of Life의 검증된 성경 커리큘럼 안에서 말씀에 깊이 뿌리내리고 복음을 전하는 리더로 성장하는 것을 목표로 합니다.</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Jr. SYME is a 3-week English discipleship training program during school breaks. Beyond language learning, students grow deep in God's Word through Word of Life's proven curriculum — equipped as leaders ready to share the Gospel.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <ol class="jr-items">
        <li class="jr-item">
          <span class="jr-item-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="jr-item-title"><span class="wl-ko">영어 집중 환경</span><span class="wl-en">English Immersion</span></h3>
            <p class="jr-item-desc"><span class="wl-ko">모든 강의와 활동이 영어로 진행됩니다. 자연스러운 환경 속에서 언어와 신앙이 함께 성장합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">All sessions are in English — faith and language grow together in a natural immersion environment.</span></p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="jr-item">
          <span class="jr-item-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="jr-item-title"><span class="wl-ko">말씀 중심 커리큘럼</span><span class="wl-en">Word-Centered Curriculum</span></h3>
            <p class="jr-item-desc"><span class="wl-ko">성경 묵상, 말씀 암송, 소그룹 나눔을 통해 하나님의 말씀 위에 삶을 세웁니다.</span><span class="wl-en">Daily devotions, Scripture memory, and small groups — building lives on the foundation of God's Word.</span></p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="jr-item">
          <span class="jr-item-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="jr-item-title"><span class="wl-ko">공동체와 제자훈련</span><span class="wl-en">Community &amp; Discipleship</span></h3>
            <p class="jr-item-desc"><span class="wl-ko">또래와 함께하는 3주간의 공동체 생활로 서로 세우고 도전하며 성장합니다.</span><span class="wl-en">3 weeks of community life with peers — challenging and building each other in faith and character.</span></p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- RELATED PROGRAMS — 남색 마무리 띠 -->
  <section class="jr-programs">
    <div class="jr-shell">
      <div class="jr-programs-head">
        <div>
          <p class="jr-eyebrow">Word of Life Worldwide</p>
          <h2 class="jr-h2">
            <span class="wl-ko">더 깊은 훈련을 원하신다면</span>
            <span class="wl-en">Looking for a Deeper Experience?</span>
          </h2>
        </div>
        <p class="jr-programs-desc">
          <span class="wl-ko">Jr. SYME 외에도 전 세계 Word of Life 훈련 프로그램을 살펴보세요. 제주 월비를 제외한 해외 프로그램은 영어 문의만 가능합니다.</span>
          <span class="wl-en">Explore other Word of Life training programs worldwide. International programs (except Jeju WOLBI) accept English inquiries only.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="jr-cards">

        <div class="jr-card">
          <p class="jr-card-region">Taiwan</p>
          <h3 class="jr-card-name">SYME Taiwan</h3>
          <ul class="jr-card-links">
            <li>
              <a class="jr-card-link" href="https://syme.woltaiwan.com/en/home" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span>syme.woltaiwan.com</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a class="jr-card-link" href="mailto:symetaiwan@gmail.com">
                <span>symetaiwan@gmail.com</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="jr-card-note"><span class="wl-ko">영어 문의만 가능</span><span class="wl-en">English only</span></p>
        </div>

        <div class="jr-card">
          <p class="jr-card-region">Jeju, Korea</p>
          <h3 class="jr-card-name">WOLBI Jeju</h3>
          <ul class="jr-card-links">
            <li>
              <a class="jr-card-link" href="https://www.wolbijeju.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span>wolbijeju.org</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a class="jr-card-link" href="mailto:wolbijeju.contact@gmail.com">
                <span>wolbijeju.contact@gmail.com</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="jr-card">
          <p class="jr-card-region">United States</p>
          <h3 class="jr-card-name">WOLBI USA</h3>
          <ul class="jr-card-links">
            <li>
              <a class="jr-card-link" href="https://wordoflife.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                <span>wordoflife.edu</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a class="jr-card-link" href="mailto:admissions@wol.org">
                <span>admissions@wol.org</span>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h11M9 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="jr-card-note"><span class="wl-ko">영어 문의만 가능</span><span class="wl-en">English only</span></p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<script is:inline>
  // Jr. SYME 움직임: 스크롤하면 글이 아래에서 차례로 떠오른다.
  // 움직임 줄이기 설정이거나 IntersectionObserver 가 없으면 아무것도 하지 않는다 — 처음부터 그대로 다 보인다.
  (function () {
    if (!('IntersectionObserver' in window)) return;
    if (window.matchMedia && window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;
    var items = [].slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('.jr .jr-notice, .jr .jr-about-copy > *, .jr .jr-item, .jr .jr-programs-head > *, .jr .jr-card'));
    items.forEach(function (el) {
      var sib = el.parentNode.children, i = [].indexOf.call(sib, el);
      el.style.setProperty('--d', Math.min(i, 6) * 0.08 + 's');
      el.classList.add('jr-rv');
    });
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
      entries.forEach(function (en) { if (en.isIntersecting) { en.target.classList.add('is-in'); io.unobserve(en.target); } });
    }, { threshold: 0.12, rootMargin: '0px 0px -6% 0px' });
    items.forEach(function (el) { io.observe(el); });
  })();
</script>

<style>
/* Jr. SYME 본문 — 사역 페이지(/ministry)와 같은 편집 디자인
   언어 표시/숨김은 global.css 가 맡으므로, .wl-ko/.wl-en 이 붙은 요소에는 display 를 주지 않는다. */
.jr {
  --jc-deep: #004f68;
  --jc-navy: #0b2430;
  --jc-ink: #10252e;
  --jc-text: #4a5d66;
  --jc-body: #3e535d;
  --jc-muted: #587383;
  --jc-label: #5a7380;
  --jc-line: #d6dee2;
  --jc-soft: #f6f9fb;
  --jc-fill: #f3f7f9;
  font-family: var(--ff-sans);
  color: var(--jc-ink);
  background: #fff;
  word-break: keep-all;
  overflow-x: clip;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
.jr-shell { width: min(1200px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
.jr svg { width: 14px; height: 14px; flex: none; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.8; stroke-linecap: square; }
.jr ol, .jr ul { list-style: none; }

/* 작은 표시 — 앞에 가는 선 */
.jr-eyebrow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; color: var(--jc-deep); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
.jr-eyebrow::before { content: ''; width: 28px; height: 1px; background: currentColor; flex: none; }
.jr-h2 { margin-top: 20px; font-family: var(--ff-serif); font-size: clamp(30px, 3.4vw, 46px); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.22; letter-spacing: -.03em; color: var(--jc-navy); }
.jr-body { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--jc-body); }

/* NOTICE — 옅은 바탕 + 고른 테두리 */
.jr-notice-wrap { padding-top: 72px; }
.jr-notice { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 24px; padding: 20px 24px; background: var(--jc-soft); border: 1px solid var(--jc-line); }
.jr-notice-label { flex: none; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--jc-deep); }
.jr-notice-text { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--jc-body); }
.jr-notice-text strong { font-weight: 700; color: var(--jc-navy); }

/* ABOUT */
.jr-about { padding: 88px 0 120px; }
.jr-about-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr); gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
.jr-items { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--jc-line); }
.jr-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 64px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 8px; padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--jc-line); }
.jr-item:first-child { border-top: 2px solid var(--jc-navy); }
.jr-item-num { font-family: var(--ff-serif); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--jc-deep); }
.jr-item-title { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--jc-navy); }
.jr-item-desc { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.85; color: var(--jc-text); }

/* RELATED PROGRAMS — 남색 띠 */
.jr-programs { padding: 112px 0 120px; background: var(--jc-navy); color: #fff; }
.jr-programs .jr-eyebrow { color: rgba(255,255,255,.78); }
.jr-programs .jr-h2 { color: #fff; font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px); line-height: 1.25; }
.jr-programs-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 5fr) minmax(0, 7fr); gap: 80px; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 64px; }
.jr-programs-desc { max-width: 560px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: rgba(255,255,255,.74); }
.jr-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 40px; }
.jr-card { padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.4); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.jr-card-region { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); }
.jr-card-name { margin-top: 10px; font-family: var(--ff-serif); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; color: #fff; }
.jr-card-links { margin-top: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
.jr-card-links li { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); }
.jr-card-link { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 15px 0; font-size: 15px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.88); text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s, gap .25s; }
.jr-card-link span { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
.jr-card-link:hover { color: #fff; }
.jr-card-link:hover span { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
.jr-card-note { margin-top: 14px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6); }

/* 스크롤하면 떠오르기 — 스크립트가 .jr-rv 를 붙일 때만 */
.jr-rv { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) var(--d, 0s), transform 1.1s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1) var(--d, 0s); }
.jr-rv.is-in { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

/* ── 반응형 ── */
@media (max-width: 980px) {
  .jr-about-inner, .jr-programs-head { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: start; }
  .jr-programs-head { gap: 24px; }
  .jr-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
}
@media (max-width: 740px) {
  .jr-shell { width: calc(100% - 40px); }
  .jr-notice-wrap { padding-top: 48px; }
  .jr-notice { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; padding: 18px 20px; }
  .jr-about { padding: 56px 0 72px; }
  .jr-body { font-size: 15.5px; }
  .jr-item { grid-template-columns: 44px minmax(0, 1fr); padding: 24px 0; }
  .jr-item-title { font-size: 17px; }
  .jr-item-desc { font-size: 15px; }
  .jr-programs { padding: 72px 0; }
  .jr-programs-head { margin-bottom: 48px; }
  .jr-programs-desc { font-size: 15px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  .jr-card-link { transition: none; }
}
</style>

</BaseLayout>
